        "created_at": "2013-04-13T23:14:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Looking at Miss Information's deck, I would tentatively place the Administrative Assassin series before Freedom Five Annual 21. There's nothing in the AA quotes to indicate that Aminia Twain has revealed herself.</p><p>An alternative possibility, of course, is that Administrative Assassin is a retelling of Freedom Five Annual #21.</p><p>On an unrelated note, the Treacherous Ape appears long before The Visionary's first appearance.</p>",
