        "created_at": "2013-04-14T07:46:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had assumed that Administrative Assassin was a retelling of Aminia's betrayal of the Freedom Five, with her as the Villain Protagonist, as per the Lex Luthor limited series from a few years back (in which he builds a suicidal robot, has Toyman murder children, and blows up a skyscraped, all while raving about how morally superior he is).</p><p>Ironic</p>",
